  {
   "kind": "linkedin-post",
   "text": "A Reiki master with no studio wrote a UK number two. An AI app made her first version, a producer rebuilt it and a house legend sang it. The Grammys couldn't file it under one word.\n\nThe work on your desk is increasingly made the same way. \"Did AI make this?\" tells you very little. Ask whose idea it was, what a tool drafted and who checked it and put their name to it.\n\nThe full deep dive is at makeyourmindup.ai."
